d 'SPLITPOPSURV': module to estimate split-population (cure / mover-stayer) survival models
d
d     splitpopsurv fits a split-population (also called a "cure" or
d "mover-stayer") survival model by maximum likelihood. It   
d combines an accelerated failure-time regression for event timing
d among "movers" (the H_regression equation, on timevar and   
d indepvars) with a logistic regression on the probability of
d belonging to a structurally immune "stayer" population (the	
d P_regression equation, on cure()). Five baseline distributions
d are available for the timing part. 
d
d KW: survival models
d KW: mover-stayer
d KW: failure time regression
d
d Requires: Stata version 17
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260923
d
d Author:  Nobutaka Fukuda ,  Tohoku University
d Support: email  nobutaka.fukuda@@tohoku.ac.jp
d
f splitpopsurv.ado
f splitpopsurv.sthlp
f splitpopsurv_d0_ggamma.ado
f splitpopsurv_lf_gamma.ado
f splitpopsurv_lf_loglogistic.ado
f splitpopsurv_lf_lognormal.ado
f splitpopsurv_lf_weibull.ado
f splitpopsurv_p.ado
